OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day and staying mostly dry in the
OL,7,Fmorning, though a few showers are
OL,8,Fpossible during late afternoon into
OL,9,Fthe evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers will clear this
OL,12,Fevening, leaving the rest of the night
OL,13,Fdry night with lengthy clear spells
OL,14,Ffor most. Turning rather cold under
OL,15,Fclear skies and light winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,18,Frisk of frost. Then remaining dry and
OL,19,Fsettled through the day with sunshine
OL,20,Fand some patchy cloud developing for
OL,21,Fthe afternoon. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
